{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:24+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:43:24+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Ferrari N.V.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"Italy","city":"Maranello","website":"https://www.ferrari.com","employees":5752,"summary":"Ferrari N.V., through its subsidiaries, engages in design, engineering, production, and sale of luxury performance sports cars worldwide. It offers sports, track, one-off, and road cars, as well as supercars. The company also provides spare parts and engines, as well as after sales, repair, maintenance, and restoration services for cars; and licenses its Ferrari brand to various producers and retailers of luxury and lifestyle goods. In addition, it operates Ferrari museums in Modena and Maranello; Il Cavallino restaurant in Maranello; and theme parks in Abu Dhabi and Spain. Further, the company provides direct or indirect finance and leasing services; range of financial and ancillary services; special financing arrangements; and operates franchised and owned Ferrari stores. The company was founded in 1947 and is headquartered in Maranello, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Ferrari N.V., par le biais de ses filiales, s'engage dans la conception, l'ingénierie, la production et la vente de voitures de sport de performance de luxe dans le monde entier. Il propose des voitures de sport, de piste, uniques et de route, ainsi que des supercars. La société fournit également des pièces de rechange et des moteurs, ainsi que des services après-vente, de réparation, d'entretien et de restauration pour les voitures; et concède sa marque Ferrari à divers producteurs et détaillants de produits de luxe et de style de vie."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":65787256832,"shares_outstanding":175222418,"trailing_pe":39.396645,"forward_pe":33